{"event_type":"review","id":"244d2c206c755eef7b6f76d9d5ab099c281730af13368b25feb4aed101101d9b","occurred_at":"2026-11-16T01:05:47Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/176bf8889183e94c87a8a053bc35868b1cc6152a91d73788045513af59a361eb","sha256":"176bf8889183e94c87a8a053bc35868b1cc6152a91d73788045513af59a361eb"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/78dc4e92cf68a30dbb0ca3776cc2e39fc11889d9b2b0541b73629f2bf7286cb3","sha256":"78dc4e92cf68a30dbb0ca3776cc2e39fc11889d9b2b0541b73629f2bf7286cb3"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/b5ca0d7e9e92de8f8c9b111d7e4441e230b89afffc85f374a5998b834f4770ae","sha256":"b5ca0d7e9e92de8f8c9b111d7e4441e230b89afffc85f374a5998b834f4770ae"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/aebaf104bbc783d7f3b5564dc74d40d0cc89f2d8c3fabec8766954288609a978","sha256":"aebaf104bbc783d7f3b5564dc74d40d0cc89f2d8c3fabec8766954288609a978"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/50428c9534ba139344179bf24558661a2382f8a56764b364239874024d769a07","sha256":"50428c9534ba139344179bf24558661a2382f8a56764b364239874024d769a07"}],"attempt_id":"80322c48c45bbc350a50bfdfaf5f3244fe80586d4cca36d51564f18b3ba3ff84:0:1","base":"251ed6cef7c62b7caf5a532316a0b776d6e19b77","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"e69f78c9eb8e96d0c5c73a04d6ac85137949a0e1","body":"**Save the terminal spawn failure before emitting `spawn_failed`.**\n\nIn the `ReviewSpawnError` branch for `author` and `local-review` items, `await effects.event('spawn_failed', ...)` runs before `await effects.saveQueue(next)`. The `ReviewLaunchEffects.event` member is declared as `Promise<void>` and has no best-effort note, so it can reject. If it rejects, the terminal save at line 140 does not run. The durable item then keeps the pre-spawn reservation: `state: 'reviewing'`, `run.pid: null`, and `run.launch_pending: true`. The known spawn failure is not recorded.\n\nSave the terminal state before emitting the event. This matches the successful path, which saves the completed run before `review_started`. An event failure then cannot prevent persistence of the spawn outcome.\n\n<details>\n<summary>Suggested fix</summary>\n\n```diff\n-    await effects.event(\n-      'spawn_failed',\n-      new JsonObject([\n-        ['item', itemId],\n-        ['run', input.runId],\n-        ['error', message],\n-      ]),\n-    );\n     await effects.saveQueue(next);\n+    await effects.event(\n+      'spawn_failed',\n+      new JsonObject([\n+        ['item', itemId],\n+        ['run', input.runId],\n+        ['error', message],\n+      ]),\n+    );\n     return { queue: next, runId: input.runId };\n```\n\n</details>","id":"9e83fb1b98892a59b5fd6fb468b3fc45493dc5f0dc11865a64120836cbc578ec","intervals":[[132,132]],"path":"src/queue-runner/reviewLaunch.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Save the terminal spawn failure before emitting `spawnfailed`."}],"head":"0dc7b536b590469ccaa808fbd2527197a986942b","head_tree":"bda143e5c3801b7c35ed31c000807c5f716cf6f6","input_scope":[{"blob":"e69f78c9eb8e96d0c5c73a04d6ac85137949a0e1","intervals":[[1,172]],"path":"src/queue-runner/reviewLaunch.ts"},{"blob":"5ee7484905781b84c769cb559a98676ad489b4da","intervals":[[1,60]],"path":"src/queue-runner/slot.ts"}],"job_id":"80322c48c45bbc350a50bfdfaf5f3244fe80586d4cca36d51564f18b3ba3ff84:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"e69f78c9eb8e96d0c5c73a04d6ac85137949a0e1","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/queue-runner/reviewLaunch.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"5ee7484905781b84c769cb559a98676ad489b4da","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","p